WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.945 --> 00:00:15.029
The guard stared at Ally.

2
00:00:16.229 --> 00:00:19.051
"You just going to stand there, or are you coming in?"

3
00:00:19.491 --> 00:00:20.491
she asked gruffly.

4
00:00:20.511 --> 00:00:23.132
"Uh Ally hesitated.

5
00:00:23.152 --> 00:00:23.973
"Not yet.

6
00:00:24.573 --> 00:00:27.214
Thanks!" Ally spun around and skittered away.

7
00:00:27.234 --> 00:00:32.316
"I have to find a quiet place to think," she thought.

8
00:00:37.044 --> 00:00:39.466
She found a restroom around the corner and ducked inside.

9
00:00:40.967 --> 00:00:45.270
She was hoping it would be empty, but several humans were inside, adjusting their costumes.

10
00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:48.432
Ally looked closely at their costumes and makeup.

11
00:00:49.312 --> 00:00:53.595
One girl was dressed like a rocket ship, and the other one wore a pair of enormous ears.

12
00:00:53.615 --> 00:00:56.057
"Yikes," Ally thought.

13
00:00:56.077 --> 00:00:58.538
"Earthlings know nothing about the universe.

14
00:00:58.999 --> 00:01:00.500
Nobody has ears like that!"

15
00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:02.741
Ally looked at another costume.

16
00:01:05.003 --> 00:01:06.544
Suddenly she knew what she had to do.

17
00:01:07.144 --> 00:01:10.725
"It's risky," she thought, swallowing hard.

18
00:01:10.745 --> 00:01:13.106
"But it's my only choice."

19
00:01:15.586 --> 00:01:20.408
She stepped into one of the stalls and took off her meld medallion, instantly reverting to her Astralian

20
00:01:20.468 --> 00:01:27.790
form. As she stepped back out of the stall, she froze, waiting for someone to react to her

21
00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:30.951
appearance. But to her relief, no one even looked at her.

22
00:01:31.751 --> 00:01:33.251
Ally grinned and headed for the hallway.

23
00:01:33.691 --> 00:01:34.472
"It worked!"

24
00:01:34.892 --> 00:01:35.272
she thought.

25
00:01:35.816 --> 00:01:40.957
"Now I just need a hiding spot for my meld medallion so I can pass through the metal

26
00:01:40.997 --> 00:01:46.159
detector." She looked around and spotted a fire extinguisher.

27
00:01:46.179 --> 00:01:52.240
"No one will bother to look here," she thought, tucking the meld medallion behind it.

28
00:01:52.261 --> 00:01:55.141
"As long as there's no fire, that is."

29
00:01:55.581 --> 00:01:56.962
Ally started back to the gallery.

30
00:01:59.182 --> 00:02:00.583
On the way people kept stopping her.

31
00:02:00.603 --> 00:02:03.424
"Cool costume!"

32
00:02:03.864 --> 00:02:04.884
a tall alien said.

33
00:02:05.416 --> 00:02:07.177
"Yeah," a purple one agreed.

34
00:02:07.197 --> 00:02:10.457
"With that outfit, you could win the contest!"

35
00:02:11.578 --> 00:02:13.318
Ally nodded and gave a thumbs-up sign.

36
00:02:13.918 --> 00:02:17.739
But if everything went smoothly, she would be heading back to her pod with the parts in a

37
00:02:17.799 --> 00:02:18.360
few minutes.

38
00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:23.341
Ally marched past the guard, through the metal detector, and right into Dr.

39
00:02:23.361 --> 00:02:24.101
Lloyd's gallery.

40
00:02:24.921 --> 00:02:25.822
"I'm almost there!"

41
00:02:26.222 --> 00:02:27.302
she thought excitedly.

42
00:02:27.642 --> 00:02:29.723
But her excitement drained away a second later.

43
00:02:29.743 --> 00:02:32.804
"There are too many people here!"

44
00:02:33.204 --> 00:02:33.664
Ally thought.

45
00:02:34.744 --> 00:02:38.327
"There's no way I can sneak into his office without being seen.

46
00:02:38.747 --> 00:02:42.510
And the room is too crowded for me to use my voice-throwing ability."

47
00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:43.891
Just then Dr.

48
00:02:43.911 --> 00:02:45.312
Lloyd stepped up to a podium.

49
00:02:45.532 --> 00:02:48.094
To his right was a large box covered by a curtain.

50
00:02:48.594 --> 00:02:50.275
The lights dimmed and he began to speak.

51
00:02:50.295 --> 00:02:55.759
"Thank you for coming, sci-fi fans and extraterrestrial experts!"

52
00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:56.700
he said.

53
00:02:56.720 --> 00:03:02.184
"As many of you surely know, I've spent my entire career searching for alien life.

54
00:03:02.924 --> 00:03:08.807
While I believe there are several advanced civilizations in the universe, there is only one species who travels

55
00:03:08.867 --> 00:03:13.870
the universe, trying to establish peace and solve intergalactic disputes."

56
00:03:15.311 --> 00:03:16.411
Ally's stomach clenched.

57
00:03:16.431 --> 00:03:18.352
"Uh-oh," she thought.

58
00:03:18.372 --> 00:03:19.573
"Here it comes.

59
00:03:20.073 --> 00:03:22.535
He's going to reveal my secret to everyone."

60
00:03:22.555 --> 00:03:26.957
"I've devoted most of my studies to these beings," Dr.

61
00:03:26.997 --> 00:03:27.837
Lloyd continued.

62
00:03:27.857 --> 00:03:34.581
"And now, through extensive research, I can finally present to you an up-close specimen!"

63
00:03:35.261 --> 00:03:38.623
Ally covered her face, certain that he was about to call her up onstage.

64
00:03:39.744 --> 00:03:40.204
But Dr.

65
00:03:40.244 --> 00:03:41.365
Lloyd didn't even look at her.

66
00:03:42.265 --> 00:03:45.227
Instead he pulled a cord on the curtain covering the box.

67
00:03:45.707 --> 00:03:51.610
It fell away to reveal a figure made of wax!

68
00:03:52.691 --> 00:03:54.872
Ally slowly peeked out from behind her fingers.

69
00:04:00.555 --> 00:04:04.780
nose is wrong," she thought, "and its feet are way too small.

70
00:04:05.761 --> 00:04:08.201
But it does look a lot like an Astralian!"

71
00:04:08.722 --> 00:04:11.302
A good Astralian would speak up right now, Ally thought.

72
00:04:11.962 --> 00:04:15.823
An Astralian would never allow a human to spread false knowledge about the species.

73
00:04:16.404 --> 00:04:20.545
But as the humans began to move closer to view the wax figure, Ally was thinking of something

74
00:04:20.645 --> 00:04:23.485
else: this was her chance to slip into Dr.

75
00:04:23.506 --> 00:04:24.186
Lloyd's office.

76
00:04:28.847 --> 00:04:30.327
A moment later she was inside.

77
00:04:30.807 --> 00:04:34.101
She quietly closed the door behind her and pulled out the map printout.

78
00:04:34.121 --> 00:04:39.204
"According to this map, the parts should be in that cabinet," she murmured.

79
00:04:40.145 --> 00:04:41.746
She ran over and flung open the door.

80
00:04:42.586 --> 00:04:45.148
But to her horror, the cabinet was almost empty.

81
00:04:46.609 --> 00:04:51.272
The only thing inside was a small black box with an antenna and a red blinking light.

82
00:04:51.292 --> 00:04:53.453
"Not again!"

83
00:04:54.074 --> 00:04:54.634
Ally moaned.

84
00:04:54.654 --> 00:04:57.716
"This time Alpha got the location wrong!"

85
00:04:58.408 --> 00:05:03.212
She looked around and started frantically rummaging through other cabinets, hoping that she'd find the parts.

86
00:05:03.653 --> 00:05:07.536
Then—bam! She gasped as the door to the office flew open.

87
00:05:08.417 --> 00:05:12.380
A tall, thin woman with glasses and a scowl on her face was standing in the doorway of

88
00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:12.881
the office.

89
00:05:12.901 --> 00:05:15.003
"What are you doing in here?"
